                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alimwi kuciindi eco Saulo ncakacili mwami, nduwe owakali kusololela ba-Israyeli akubaboozya, nkabela Jehova wakakwaambila kuti, Uleelede kweembela bantu bangu ba-Israyeli, uleelede kuba simalelaabo ba-Israyeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
