            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lino ba-Filisti nibakamvwa kuti bananika Davida mbuli mwami wabaIsrayeli, ba-Filisti boonse bakainka kuyoomuyandaula Davida, nkabela Davida naakamvwa obo wakaseluka kuya kumampangala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
